ategory":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":20.9139,"lng":-100.74448},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_mama_mia","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.mamamia.com.mx/index.php","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mamamia","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"},null,{"open":"08:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Closed Sat"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Mama Mia's is four clubs in one. There's a restaurant and bar in the center with some amazing Italian food, a sports bar to the left (usually displaying a soccer or football game of some kind), a music bar to the right where local acts frequently play (especially Pilaseca, a very popular funk-blues band that tours most of Mexico and the States), and a hard-to-find rooftop lounge overlooking the ci","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Miguel de Allende"},{"id":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_grill_garden","areaId":"san_miguel_de_allende","name":"Grill & Garden","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":20.94695,"lng":-100.75718},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_grill_garden","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.los-senderos.mx/index.php?lengua=eng&pagina=main&seccion=004_GGeng","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["grillgarden","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[null,null,null,null,{"open":"13:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"19:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu"},"summary":"Relaxed country atmosphere serving old favorites and innovative fusion dishes – the restaurant has its own organic herb and vegetable garden. Great place to take visitors, and kids – bicycles available and horse back rides by reservation. Gets very busy on Sundays, reservations recommended. This charming place also prepares gourmet picnics, and available for private events.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Miguel de Allende"},{"id":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_posada_carmina","areaId":"san_miguel_de_allende","name":"Posada Carmina","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":20.91336,"lng":-100.74408},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_posada_carmina","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.posadacarmina.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["posadacarmina","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"This restaurant is based in the patio of a charming inn located in a remarkably well preserved colonial house. Branded as 'fusion', the food offered by this restaurant will make your visit to San Miguel even more memorable, it mixes the classic elements of Mexican cuisine with oriental flavors and dishes.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Miguel de Allende"},{"id":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_la_grotta","areaId":"san_miguel_de_allende","name":"La Grotta","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":20.91271,"lng":-100.74404},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_la_grotta","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.lagrotta.com.mx/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lagrotta","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"A wonderful, multi-story restaurant owned by Daniel and son Dyami. La Grotta is located downhill, around the corner, just a block from the main cathedral. The restaurant is casual and the main items are pizza, calzones, and Italian-related. The food is very carefully and freshly prepared.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Miguel de Allende"},{"id":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_cafe_yenatu_panza","areaId":"san_miguel_de_allende","name":"Café Yenatu Panza","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":20.92291,"lng":-100.74192},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_cafe_yenatu_panza","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/yenatupanza","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafeyenatupanza","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"12:00"}]},"summary":"This is undoubtedly the most innovative and creative breakfast menus in town featuring design-your-own omelets & breakfast burritos, exquisite French toast, and home made fruit salsa. The vibe is very comfy and clients can choose from indoor or outdoor-garden seating.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Miguel de Allende"},{"id":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_cafe_de_la_parroquia_la_brasserie","areaId":"san_miguel_de_allende","name":"Café de la Parroquia / La Brasserie","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":20.9133,"lng":-100.74465},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"san_miguel_de_allende_wv_cafe_de_la_parroquia_la_brasserie","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafedelaparroquialabrasserie","sanmigueldeallende"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"18:00","close"